msgctxt "48\t136"
msgid "December 2005"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "163\t276"
msgid "After the 10 billion yen incident..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "294\t485"
msgid ""
"...I turned over a new leaf and started\\na new chapter in my life with "
"Haruka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "497\t604"
msgid "We enjoyed our new, peaceful life..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "605\t749"
msgid "...and did our best to support each other\\nin the days that followed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944\t1082"
msgid "\"I don't wanna lose any more loved ones.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1153\t1360"
msgid ""
"Contrary to Haruka's wishes, it was when\\nwe were at the graves of those "
"we'd lost..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396\t1521"
msgid "...that the next chapter in our struggle\\nbegan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1547\t1715"
msgid ""
"I'm thinking of calling a truce with\\nChairman Goda of the Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1716\t1750"
msgid "A truce?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1785\t1934"
msgid ""
"Terada had taken over after me,\\nbecoming the Tojo Clan's fifth chairman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1942\t2130"
msgid ""
"And now he was considering a truce\\nwith the largest organization in Osaka⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2147\t2270"
msgid "⑬the Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2302\t2405"
msgid "Yet it was not a truce that awaited him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2670\t2700"
msgid "Die!"
msgstr "Muori!"

msgctxt "2978\t3055"
msgid "Terada was shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3117\t3203"
msgid "As he struggled to remain conscious..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3213\t3390"
msgid "...he asked me to carry out the truce\\nwith the Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3443\t3525"
msgid "The Tojo Clan had grown weak."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3526\t3708"
msgid "The loss of its chairman could be fatal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3746\t3879"
msgid "I went back to Kamurocho to save the clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3888\t3948"
msgid "I had to go back there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3959\t4040"
msgid "...to meet a man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4093\t4301"
msgid "He was a young man belonging to my old\\norganization⑬the Dojima Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4314\t4464"
msgid "He was the son of Sohei Dojima,\\npatriarch of the Dojima Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4490\t4593"
msgid "His name was Daigo Dojima."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4660\t4810"
msgid "Return to the Tojo Clan. They need you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4849\t5070"
msgid "One mistake in the negotiations and I\\nwould be a dead man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5091\t5217"
msgid "If anything were to happen to me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5236\t5406"
msgid "...Daigo was the only one I could trust\\nto run the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5420\t5515"
msgid "Weren't you the one who fucked\\neverything up a year ago?!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5530\t5695"
msgid "Yeah. And that's why I'm back.\\nTo take responsibility!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5809\t5869"
msgid "However..."
msgstr "Però..."

msgctxt "5900\t5985"
msgid "Take care of the Tojo Clan while I'm gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5986\t6060"
msgid "No. I'm going with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6061\t6085"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "6100\t6200"
msgid "I have some unfinished business in Osaka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6201\t6228"
msgid "Daigo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6280\t6440"
msgid "It doesn't matter what you say.\\nI'll go with or without you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6702\t6911"
msgid "And so Daigo and I went to Osaka..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6929\t7014"
msgid "...to call a truce between the Tojo Clan\\nand the Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""
